{"availability":"available","full":"Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf","name":"purrdf","description":"PurRDF — one RDF 1.2 engine, one behavior, in Rust, Python, WebAssembly and C. Deterministic BM25 full-text search, exact GeoSPARQL 1.1 and embedding kNN answered from SPARQL, in-process, over one dataset: the three jobs a triple store usually kept PostgreSQL beside it for. Plus native codecs, RDFC-1.0, SHACL, ShEx, entailment and GTS transport.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":50,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-01T15:40:37Z","updated":"2026-10-19T22:15:10Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://blackcatinformatics.ca/purrdf/","topics":["canonicalization","deterministic","full-text-search","geosparql","gts","json-ld","knowledge-graph","linked-data","python","rdf","rdf-1-2","rdf-star","rust","semantic-web","shacl","shex","sparql","sparql-1-2","turtle","webassembly"],"demo":"https://blackcat-informatics.github.io/purrdf/playground/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.067Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.067Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.067Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:40.436Z","stars":48,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:35:03.986Z","stars":48,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-06T22:53:45.839Z","stars":48,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T18:01:18.720Z","stars":48,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:10:54.114Z","stars":48,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-17T00:52:14.469Z","stars":49,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.067Z","stars":50,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RDF 1.2, reasoning, retrieval, and graph transport — one Rust engine, shared across languages.","One RDF engine. One behavior. Every language.","PurRDF is a Rust toolkit for building applications around knowledge graphs. It brings RDF 1.2, SPARQL, validation, reasoning, text and vector retrieval, document codecs, and graph transport into one engine. Python, JavaScript / WebAssembly, and C call that engine rather than reimplementing it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"77610285422ac2e6469e5aa9362c2a702c8db64f3c573313a409d6303d9c9391","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.149Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.149Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RDF 1.2, reasoning, retrieval, and graph transport — one Rust engine, shared across languages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"77610285422ac2e6469e5aa9362c2a702c8db64f3c573313a409d6303d9c9391","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.150Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T22:15:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.152Z","hash":"77610285422ac2e6469e5aa9362c2a702c8db64f3c573313a409d6303d9c9391","originalBytes":26842,"storedBytes":26842,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:50.067Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:53.933Z","latestRelease":{"name":"PurRDF 3.0.1","tag":"rust-v3.0.1","publishedAt":"2026-10-03T00:59:48Z","url":"https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/releases/tag/rust-v3.0.1"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:53.933Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/fb4b568e00799bab91694aa5.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T22:36:25.182Z","url":"https://blackcat-informatics.github.io/purrdf/playground/"}],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:16:13.503Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://blackcat-informatics.github.io/purrdf/playground/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T22:36:25.182Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:36:25.182Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T22:36:25.182Z","target":"https://blackcat-informatics.github.io/purrdf